  "body": "## Summary\n\nMajor refactor of sharun, splitting the monolithic `src/main.rs` into separate modules and extending functionality.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Module split\n- **`src/main.rs`** \u2014 entry point, CLI/flags, bin detection, interpreter setup, exec logic (372 lines, down from 1184)\n- **`src/utils.rs`** \u2014 all helper/utility functions including `read_dotenv`, ELF parsing, env manipulation\n- **`src/apprun.rs`** \u2014 AppRun mode handler\n- **`src/set_appdir_env.rs`** \u2014 directory parsing + env var setup (`set_lib_env`, `set_share_env`, `set_etc_env`)\n- **`src/gio_launch_desktop.rs`** \u2014 gio-launch-desktop mode handler\n\n### New features\n- Added `gio-launch-desktop` mode: sets `GIO_LAUNCHED_DESKTOP_FILE_PID`, execs args\n- Added `APPIMAGE_ARCH` (compile-time arch constant) and `APPIMAGE_UID` (from getuid FFI) env vars\n- Added `HOSTPATH` (PATH before modification), `HOST_HOME`, `HOST_XDG_*` env vars to AppRun\n\n### Removed\n- Removed `.app` file feature from AppRun (only `.desktop` files now)\n- Removed `ARGV0` env var and `arg0` parameter from `run_as_apprun`\n\n### Dependency change\n- Replaced `dotenv` crate with inline single-pass parser (handles `KEY=VALUE`, `export` prefix, quote stripping, `#` comments, `unset` directives). Fixes a bug in the forked dotenv where lines after `unset` were lost.\n\n### Other\n- Converted all `.rs` files to tabs\n- Bumped version `1.0.0` \u2192 `2.0.0`\n- Updated repository URL",
