  "body": "Rare scenario now that VDPAU is removed and that VDPAU-exclusive apps are rare. One of those apps is Adobe Flash Player.\nBy default it tries to use `libvdpau_nvidia.so`, which obviously fails in non-Nvidia systems.\n\nUntil Max wakes up from winter, I will make the issue here, along with the sharun repo.\n\nI guess this can be easily solved by hook.",
